 read and write lost until restored (no data loss unless unrecoverable). Multi-region\nsingle-write: service-managed failover (can take 1 h or more to declare) or forced failover (unreplicated-write\nloss); PPAF option. Multi-write: automatic routing. RPO by consistency: session, consistent prefix, eventual\nunder 15 min; bounded staleness = min(100,000 writes, 300 s) for multi-region; strong = 0.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Single region: read and write lost until restored (no data loss unless unrecoverable). Multi-region\nsingle-write: service-managed failover (can take 1 h or more to declare) or forced failover (unreplicated-write\nloss); PPAF option. Multi-write: automatic routing. RPO by consistency: session, consistent prefix, eventual\nunder 15 min; bounded staleness = min(100,000 writes, 300 s) for multi-region; strong = 0.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"_LUAegWO6baPafClxH8g9","type":"text","x":1492.0,"y":4979.0,"width":230.0,"height":52.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["HRWRi-XCMHMt88i3FYBRP"],"frameId":null,"index":"bAV","roundness":null,"seed":996273979,"version":2,"versionNonce":736791537,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Resource Health, Service Health,\nAzure Monitor alerts on Cosmos\nDB","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Resource Health, Service Health,\nAzure Monitor alerts on Cosmos\nDB","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"oczzeC3dGjUvXUtLf_-Xq","type":"text","x":1742.0,"y":4979.0,"width":770.0,"height":17.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["HRWRi-XCMHMt88i3FYBRP"],"frameId":null,"index":